	(text "auto-retry functionality and the ability to enable or disable with an external logic signal.\nFigure 28 shows how an external logic signal can drive EN through RFAULT and maintain auto-retry functionality.\nThe resistor-capacitor time constant determines the auto-retry time-out period."
